//! | the name is `__Host-` plus a non-empty suffix that does not start with `-` | [`host_session`], at construction |
//! | `Path=/` | [`host_session`] sets it, and [`render`] re-checks it |
//! | `Secure` | `ResponseCookie::session` sets it, and [`render`] re-checks it |
//! | no `Domain` | `ResponseCookie` has no `Domain` builder, and [`render`] re-checks it |
//! | a read looks for the SAME prefixed name | [`host_cookie_value`] |
